{
  "title": "frota360-api",
  "interval": 60,
  "rules": [
    {
      "uid": "frota360-taxa-5xx",
      "title": "Taxa de 5xx acima de 5%",
      "condition": "C",
      "for": "1m",
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "labels": {
        "servico": "frota360-api",
        "severidade": "critica"
      },
      "annotations": {
        "summary": "{{ $labels.deployment_environment_name }}: {{ humanizePercentage $values.B.Value }} das requisições responderam 5xx nos últimos 5 minutos.",
        "description": "Erro inesperado no servidor (banco fora do ar, exceção não tratada). Veja os erros por rota no painel e os logs de nível Error no Loki.",
        "__dashboardUid__": "frota360-api",
        "__panelId__": "12"
      },
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "${CONTATO}"
      },
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
          "model": {
            "refId": "A",
            "instant": true,
            "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment_name) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"frota360-api\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum by (deployment_environment_name) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"frota360-api\"}[5m]))"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce",
            "expression": "A",
            "reducer": "last"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "threshold",
            "expression": "B",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "type": "gt",
                  "params": [
                    0.05
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "frota360-latencia-p95",
      "title": "Latência p95 acima de 1 s",
      "condition": "C",
      "for": "5m",
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "labels": {
        "servico": "frota360-api",
        "severidade": "alta"
      },
      "annotations": {
        "summary": "{{ $labels.deployment_environment_name }}: p95 de {{ humanizeDuration $values.B.Value }} há 5 minutos (meta da RNF01: 500 ms).",
        "description": "Veja as rotas mais lentas no painel e abra um trace lento no Tempo para ver se o tempo está no banco ou numa API externa.",
        "__dashboardUid__": "frota360-api",
        "__panelId__": "10"
      },
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "${CONTATO}"
      },
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
          "model": {
            "refId": "A",
            "instant": true,
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, deployment_environment_name) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"frota360-api\"}[5m])))"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce",
            "expression": "A",
            "reducer": "last"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "threshold",
            "expression": "B",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "type": "gt",
                  "params": [
                    1
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "frota360-pico-429",
      "title": "Pico de respostas 429",
      "condition": "C",
      "for": "0s",
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "labels": {
        "servico": "frota360-api",
        "severidade": "media"
      },
      "annotations": {
        "summary": "{{ $labels.deployment_environment_name }}: {{ $values.B.Value }} requisições barradas pelo rate limit em 5 minutos.",
        "description": "Possível força bruta no login ou cliente em loop. Os logs de login mostram o domínio do e-mail (mascarado) e o IP fica na auditoria.",
        "__dashboardUid__": "frota360-api",
        "__panelId__": "18"
      },
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "${CONTATO}"
      },
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
          "model": {
            "refId": "A",
            "instant": true,
            "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment_name) (increase(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"frota360-api\", http_response_status_code=\"429\"}[5m]))"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce",
            "expression": "A",
            "reducer": "last"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "threshold",
            "expression": "B",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "type": "gt",
                  "params": [
                    20
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "frota360-integracoes",
      "title": "Falhas nas integrações externas",
      "condition": "C",
      "for": "0s",
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "labels": {
        "servico": "frota360-api",
        "severidade": "media"
      },
      "annotations": {
        "summary": "{{ $labels.deployment_environment_name }}: {{ $values.B.Value }} chamadas a {{ $labels.server_address }} falharam em 15 minutos.",
        "description": "Na Google Routes, costuma ser cota estourada ou chave inválida; no Resend, domínio não verificado ou chave revogada. O motivo técnico está no log.",
        "__dashboardUid__": "frota360-api",
        "__panelId__": "17"
      },
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "${CONTATO}"
      },
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 1200,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
          "model": {
            "refId": "A",
            "instant": true,
            "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment_name, server_address) (increase(http_client_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"frota360-api\", error_type!=\"\"}[15m]))"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "refId": "B",
            "type": "reduce",
            "expression": "A",
            "reducer": "last"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "refId": "C",
            "type": "threshold",
            "expression": "B",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "type": "gt",
                  "params": [
                    3
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}